; COM:
; 1. During first run 'llc' PreLegalizer mostly do nothing,
;    but Legalizer recognizes some special pattern and generates shr/trunc
;    instructions set.
;    It's checked by UDIV0-kw.
; 2. During the second run 'llc' PreLegalizer recognizes the pattern shr/trunc
;    and optimizes it according to specified rule.
;    It's checked by UDIV1-kw.
; This is actual for test w/ UDIV0/UDIV1-kws.

